   <property name="html">
    <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
hr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }
li.unchecked::marker { content: &quot;\2610&quot;; }
li.checked::marker { content: &quot;\2612&quot;; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','Droid Sans Mono','monospace','monospace'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Disclaimer:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','Droid Sans Mono','monospace','monospace'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;This software is provided &amp;quot;as-is&amp;quot; without any express or implied warranties, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability or fitness for a particular purpose. The author is not responsible for any damages, data loss, or issues arising from the use of this software. Use at your own risk.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','Droid Sans Mono','monospace','monospace'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;This program is freeware; no special licenses are required to use this software (whether in a private or commercial setting). However, you are NOT allowed to lease, sell, or distribute this software commercially in any way. Redistribution for private use/purposes is generally not an issue, but for any other reason, we kindly ask that you link to the original XNL R36 Linux Partition Sizer page instead. This helps prevent cluttering the internet with outdated versions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','Droid Sans Mono','monospace','monospace'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;NOTE: The XNL R36 Linux Partition Sizers is officially only intended for the R36S and R36H while using the OFFICIAL ArkOS image (the RG351MP version), the AeolusUX version has also been tested and proven to be working correctly. This program should in theory also work for quite a few other ArkOS versions for other devices, but those are not officially supported in ANY way. The ONLY officially supported version for this program is the Official RG351MP ArkOS when using it for the R36S or R36H.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','Droid Sans Mono','monospace','monospace'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;This program uses the Qt framework (and Qt Widgets), which are licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License (LGPL).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','Droid Sans Mono','monospace','monospace'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;For more information, see: https://www.qt.io/licensing/&lt;br /&gt;This application is build using Qt Creator&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','Droid Sans Mono','monospace','monospace'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;For the full and official license of this program, please refer to the official website:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','Droid Sans Mono','monospace','monospace'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;https://www.teamxnl.com/R36-Linux-Partition-Sizer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','Droid Sans Mono','monospace','monospace'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;TIP: The source code for this program (written in C++ using Qt for the UI) is also available for educational purposes on the official website.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','Droid Sans Mono','monospace','monospace'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Special Thanks and Credits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','Droid Sans Mono','monospace','monospace'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Thanks to Christian Haitian for his amazing work on ArkOS.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','Droid Sans Mono','monospace','monospace'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Thanks to AeolusUX for his work with the Community Maintained version, especially for devices like the R36S and R36H.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','Droid Sans Mono','monospace','monospace'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;The Linux Mascot (Tux) was drawn by Larry Ewing (lewing@isc.tamu.edu) using GIMP.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','Droid Sans Mono','monospace','monospace'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The icons/graphics in this application are my own work, except for the 'NES-Like-Controller,' which is a CC0 Clipart from:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','Droid Sans Mono','monospace','monospace'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;https://publicdomainvectors.org/en/free-clipart/Nintendo-8-bit-controller/71592.html&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','Droid Sans Mono','monospace','monospace'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;My images, however, are NOT CC0 and thus not 'up-for-grabs.' 😉&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','Droid Sans Mono','monospace','monospace'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;The XNL Future Technologies logo is a ® Registered Trademark of XNL Future Technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
   </property>
